[{"title":"梦中游天台作","author":"李英","text":"裹药囊琴度岭来，乍辞沧海访天台。\n云连邛杖能扶我，石引名山岂用媒。\n古洞酒禅初下榻，玉壶仙女共登台。\n游魂彷漾茫茫起，月浸桃花一棹回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16051,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送顾别驾暂还姑苏","author":"李英","text":"佐郡承钦命，炎荒有政声。\n祇因惊岁序，难阻忆鲈情。\n地僻游偏倦，官清装自轻。\n东山须早出，国计借长城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16052,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋玩月扁舟小集","author":"李英","text":"丛桂花当发，良宵月正圆。\n旋沽村店酒，胜赏木兰船。\n老志为渔长，鸥群以我先。\n秋江频下钓，盟好总忘年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16053,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用韵酬赵山人君宠","author":"李英","text":"水石桥边隐逸人，四时头戴白纶巾。\n修成竹径方为社，寻得桃源岂避秦。\n尔伴青霞偏爱僻，我群黄鹤幸相亲。\n由来粤海多灵异，老蚌遗珠席上珍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16054,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对剑","author":"李英","text":"剑气光芒射斗牛，少年曾佩上幽州。\n人龙去住八千里，猿鹤睽违二十秋。\n拙计只今凭马磨，垂纶依旧著羊裘。\n西窗昨夜耽高枕，梦斩楼兰羯虏头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16055,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居","author":"李英","text":"风餐水宿傲云烟，炼药茅茨大壑边。\n羽客山僧为社好，日中说法夜谈玄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16056,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日","author":"李英","text":"老大登高陪少壮，芒鞋荒径步行迟。\n酒阑人醉风吹倒，好似参军落帽时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16057,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重阳后一日梁怀琮见过","author":"李英","text":"摇落粤江东，苍茫夕照中。\n黄花开令节，白发怯秋风。\n万事吾何有，一尊客与同。\n青山劳极目，高阁送飞鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16058,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四会程三尹虞仲奉藩司委解料北上偶遇羊城赋赠一首","author":"李英","text":"蓟北分携三十年，何期此会粤台边。\n藏真洞壑惭余拙，为政风流羡尔贤。\n万仞峰头占紫气，五层楼上啸青天。\n飘摇旌旆难为别，岭海寒飙送使船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16059,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄程光禄无过","author":"李英","text":"光禄燕京旧有名，衔恩遥出豫章城。\n才华佐郡多清洒，指点西山放逸情。\n飞梦终宵依剑舄，登龙何日慰生平。\n楚天搔首相思剧，双鲤沧江远寄声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16060,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立冬客馆病坐","author":"李英","text":"羁旅立冬时，凄风擗面吹。\n病多丝发短，愁怯雪霜欺。\n人事频如幻，纵横一似棋。\n寒暄何足问，天地总无私。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16061,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦雨二首 其一","author":"李英","text":"旬日严冬雨，行人各断魂。\n朔风吹粤峤，犹自掩柴门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16062,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦雨二首 其二","author":"李英","text":"商祈千日晴，农望四时雨。\n要得万姓欢，天公犹难处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16063,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小雪垆头口占","author":"李英","text":"蚤起茅檐挂酒旗，生涯萧瑟竟谁知。\n当垆愧乏惊人句，游侠胡来索我诗。\n几口食贫犹色笑，一身匏系谢桐丝。\n篱花雪下开将尽，乍看江梅又发枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16064,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夜赋酬周山人益泮诸弟侄见怀","author":"李英","text":"小小茅亭住海边，朔风萧飒水连天。\n独看瑞雪愁难赋，相对寒灯夜懒眠。\n度岭纷飞沙漠雁，临流欲发剡溪船。\n所思群从幽栖僻，日有霞餐不费钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16065,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访赵隐君裘卿","author":"李英","text":"逸客閒居胜，寒溪九曲深。\n苦吟双鬓白，倾盖百年心。\n行乐堪杯酒，清修在竹林。\n钓竿随所适，烟艇五湖阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16066,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访刘公子孟羽","author":"李英","text":"浊世佳公子，同餐粤峤霞。\n朔风吹木叶，雪色点梅花。\n飘泊羊城客，淹留剡曲槎。\n放怀忘逆旅，长醉不思家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16067,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访赵山人尔真","author":"李英","text":"望之不尽沧江水，餐得无穷绝峤霞。\n短褐逍遥长独往，桃源深处访君家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16068,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梁继先召饮","author":"李英","text":"夕阳停棹锦岩隈，新好招携酌我杯。\n丛菊花残观赏罢，登楼初赋雪中梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16069,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日閒步龟山晚过虚白斋遇慧上人","author":"李英","text":"寻幽扶竹仗，徐步白云端。\n蛮语沈吟处，山花带笑看。\n逢僧披大衲，拉我坐蒲团。\n仰面观天象，青霞许共餐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16070,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬至夜坐","author":"李英","text":"丈夫失志为黄金，采蕨归来返照临。\n食息苟存凭短剑，贫居如洗有孤琴。\n篝灯永夜浑忘寐，抱膝疏窗只谩吟。\n长至寒梅花正发，雪中清赏慰愁心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16071,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小除夕怀康茂才思卫","author":"李英","text":"寂寞小年夜，入龙不可群。\n堆窗多落叶，绕径有飞云。\n雁色江关起，猿声洞壑闻。\n怜余贫病冗，消渴独怀君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16072,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮山中哭子","author":"李英","text":"父存儿已殁，寒馁有谁依。\n不念身无后，堪怜死是归。\n西山时日短，南极梦魂飞。\n大壑餐霞处，哀号坐翠微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16073,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过韶州宿芙蓉驿","author":"李英","text":"暂宿沧洲上，离乡已几宵。\n海风秋飒飒，江月夜寥寥。\n归梦青山远，椷书白雁遥。\n谁知羁旅客，终是恋渔樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16074,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吉水道中","author":"李英","text":"雪霁雨霏霏，关河雁影稀。\n乡书何处达，归梦逐云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16075,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬戌除夕寓九江官舍","author":"李英","text":"腊尽长途客，官斋度此宵。\n思乡千里外，归梦九江遥。\n海树春将到，溪梅雪未消。\n问程心更远，惆怅路迢迢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16076,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江州元日","author":"李英","text":"献岁天涯赋独醒，东风旌旆满津亭。\n九霄日暖山云碧，万国春回海树青。\n匡岳有怀频倚剑，江湖作客即浮萍。\n可堪时序愁中过，岭外孤鸿只自听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16077,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"麻城大雪趋光山","author":"李英","text":"匹马冲寒客未归，飘飘片雪满山飞。\n荒村古驿知何处，回首云深锁翠微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16078,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登真定城楼","author":"李英","text":"高阁岧峣倚碧空，汉关北望几千重。\n翩翩归雁西山外，又过春云万丈峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16079,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初至燕京寓报国寺登毗卢阁","author":"李英","text":"宝殿淩霄锦绣中，倚阑南望楚天空。\n思乡泪满伤春目，鸿雁飞飞路不穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16080,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送胡子南还","author":"李英","text":"江南春尽杏花残，送客长亭欲别难。\n握手分岐君万里，帝城明月共谁看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16081,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日漫兴","author":"李英","text":"炎天独坐昼偏长，游子燕台忆故乡。\n寂寞斋中谁共语，愁看双燕话雕梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16082,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游郑园","author":"李英","text":"挟弹章台路，开尊郑谷边。\n看花随曲涧，倚树听鸣蝉。\n浊酒云林下，浮生海岳前。\n彯缨何处客，犹咏帝京篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16083,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋对月","author":"李英","text":"白露滴梧桐，秋声满太空。\n宾朋金谷里，歌舞玉楼中。\n明月千家色，清尊几处同。\n那堪沧海客，犹自叹飘蓬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16084,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋晓漫兴","author":"李英","text":"长天万里晓烟分，塞雁南飞度朔云。\n落叶凄凄寒色早，城头悲角不堪闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16085,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何少积还秦中","author":"李英","text":"秋草正萋萋，秋云逐马蹄。\n乡心频对酒，驿舍但闻鸡。\n路隔千山远，云浮万树低。\n题诗相忆处，回首玉门西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16086,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日登宣武门楼","author":"李英","text":"九日周南客，千山蓟北楼。\n高云扶殿出，紫气抱城流。\n海树含斜日，关门送晚秋。\n不堪风景异，吟望思悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16087,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十月京师纪事","author":"李英","text":"朔气萧萧落木声，边庭飞檄到秦京。\n将军转战天山北，万里胡尘一扫平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16088,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夜怀黎国辉","author":"李英","text":"空斋飞雪夜，愁思共纷纷。\n鲁酒那堪醉，边笳不可闻。\n云寒迷月色，风急断鸿群。\n寂寞同为客，裁诗一寄君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16089,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲子元日晓望","author":"李英","text":"长空耿耿断鸿声，晓日春风满帝城。\n沙漠浮云千树敛，蓟门积雪万家明。\n他乡客舍南归梦，故国亲庭北望情。\n自笑谁如班定远，佣书犹得就功名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16090,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上元日游西苑有作","author":"李英","text":"冉冉春声度绮罗，相随行乐意如何。\n花开上苑东风早，日落中原北雁多。\n烟暖晴光浮碣石，雪消澌水下滹沱。\n建章灯火谁能赋，惟与都人击壤歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16091,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十六夜同黎国辉过集李时芳馆得开字","author":"李英","text":"长安明月綵云堆，丝管东风几度来。\n燕甸雪晴三辅晓，蓟门春动百花开。\n胡姬市酒连宵醉，蛮语联诗岂论才。\n交在一时豪侠地，貂裘忘却在天台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16092,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈子问之汴梁","author":"李英","text":"蓟北论交日，相看意气深。\n驱车千里别，把袂百年心。\n草色连长道，莺声满上林。\n怜君睢水去，明月共谁吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16093,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄世达还潭城","author":"李英","text":"济南君又去，分手帝城边。\n东海秦云尽，西山蓟雪连。\n玉鞍驰驿路，金柳拂江烟。\n一别成千里，芳春思黯然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16094,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日卧病有作","author":"李英","text":"芳春将已半，犹自掩山房。\n雨过流尘净，灯悬暗壁光。\n苦吟双客鬓，久病一禅床。\n明日新晴好，寻花向草堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16095,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游西山经玉泉池望西湖","author":"李英","text":"野外尘氛绝，诸天望不迷。\n溪深春日淡，烟重绿杨低。\n石壁僧同赋，山园鸟自啼。\n扁舟乘兴地，谁共泛湖西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16096,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"香山寺","author":"李英","text":"古寺名山上，长歌且漫游。\n夕岩回照入，春壑断冰流。\n远雁翩翩过，残霞片片浮。\n五云回首处，佳气满皇州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16097,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"碧云寺","author":"李英","text":"古刹何年启，禅堂倚碧霄。\n烟深千树密，云断众峰遥。\n客过闻山磬，僧来候石桥。\n何当尘世隔，丹壑路迢迢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16098,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿金山寺","author":"李英","text":"高斋何寂寂，梵落半空声。\n萝月窥禅榻，松醪慰客情。\n冰霜千涧合，钟磬一溪清。\n胜赏浑忘寐，长廊只独行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16099,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游弘法寺","author":"李英","text":"久客滞燕州，时寻宝地游。\n幽栖随鸟入，徙倚听泉流。\n林树笼禅阁，烟霞绕佛楼。\n高僧同一笑，何异虎溪头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16100,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈子之闽中","author":"李英","text":"都门频送别，此别更踌躇。\n闽海诸天尽，燕山万里馀。\n莺声情不断，春色意何如。\n后夜能相忆，殷勤一寄书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16101,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅馆初度书怀","author":"李英","text":"三月今将半，韶光转眼频。\n飘零悲短剑，意气竟何人。\n世事看年长，生涯作客贫。\n莺花曾几醉，又过帝城春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16102,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黎悦勤之嘉兴","author":"李英","text":"结束向南州，江城暑气收。\n山连吴会郡，溪送越来舟。\n烟柳藏官道，江鸥伴客游。\n西湖知有赋，应寄蓟门秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16103,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同吴子福访黄山人不遇","author":"李英","text":"步屧城隅路，相期一访君。\n竹迷深径转，鸟向隔溪闻。\n石磴连苍藓，柴门掩白云。\n亦知非避世，何事去人群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16104,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日游永光寺","author":"李英","text":"石径经行处，禅堂爱客吟。\n残花含雨落，新竹入园深。\n松偃苔能上，山高日易沈。\n僧来同把袂，半偈去尘心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16105,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏夜对月怀吴子福","author":"李英","text":"山房尘虑绝，寂寞亦堪怜。\n明月高楼笛，青毡独夜眠。\n砧声连汉苑，竹色淡江烟。\n竟夕难成赋，怀君益渺然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16106,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜雨","author":"李英","text":"忽闻灵雨至，萧飒暗飞声。\n风急摇秦树，云深护汉京。\n楼前千幛合，天际百泉鸣。\n颇惬渔樵计，沧浪无限情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16107,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送蒙士贤游泰山三首 其一","author":"李英","text":"病里忆行踪，征车不可从。\n知君回首处，天上二茅龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16108,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送蒙士贤游泰山三首 其二","author":"李英","text":"日观闻山钟，风烟几万重。\n飞倦如可觅，真蹑白云踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16109,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送蒙士贤游泰山三首 其三","author":"李英","text":"尔去归何日，烟霞意气同。\n为余谈胜事，秋色万山中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16110,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄黄国钺","author":"李英","text":"津亭一别阻云霄，万里关河白雁遥。\n世事纷然无可道，江乡秖自忆渔樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16111,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送蒙于湛之繁昌","author":"李英","text":"匹马萧萧度汉关，孤城独眺谢公山。\n蓟门秋色期君赋，客路风烟早策还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16112,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹫峰寺避暑晚过水塘庵","author":"李英","text":"珠林行乐地，乘兴一追攀。\n曲水通诸沼，浮云断九关。\n衔杯吟白雪，说法问青山。\n莫向风尘客，彯缨看往还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16113,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客舍秋怀","author":"李英","text":"天涯长作客，摇落又逢秋。\n宝剑丹心苦，朱颜玉镜愁。\n片云飞大泽，尺牍阻沧洲。\n画角边声急，西风独倚楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16114,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日时芳携酒邀集国辉馆赏菊","author":"李英","text":"怜君一尊酒，把袂故人家。\n况是他乡客，同看九日花。\n轻烟迷远树，孤雁度残霞。\n回首千山外，长城起暮笳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16115,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重阳后一日庭前对菊因寄舍弟","author":"李英","text":"重阳又一日，客子尚天涯。\n大被连年别，东篱几度花。\n浮云飞大漠，征雁去长沙。\n欲寄江南信，何时可到家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16116,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重阳后二日出游善果寺因寄乡友","author":"李英","text":"梵宇何寂阒，西风野客游。\n青山当落日，黄菊过深秋。\n把酒会开径，思乡独上楼。\n怀君心更远，落叶送离愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16117,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿归义寺","author":"李英","text":"明月满珠林，僧谈夜已深。\n虽云车马地，独有薜萝心。\n客枕能高卧，禅房寄短吟。\n风流莲社在，陶令许招寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16118,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金门瞻望","author":"李英","text":"幽燕直北是皇州，宝殿遥瞻御气浮。\n五色云中秦树暝，九重天上汉宫秋。\n霜清象列金门里，日出鸦翻紫阁头。\n歌颂太平惭草莽，不知何以奏宸旒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16119,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送客之江南","author":"李英","text":"江南千里道，君去驿途劳。\n山遥关树暗，云尽楚天高。\n秋风吹客骑，朔雪满征袍。\n自怜经岁月，何处望亭皋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16120,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送姚子才还金陵","author":"李英","text":"匹马出皇州，燕歌不可留。\n相携怜楚璧，赠别惜吴钩。\n旅食三秋梦，乡书万里愁。\n看君冲雪去，独自下西楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":16121,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]